type: bullet-list
title: MdArt Syntax Tour

- Plain label
- Label: value
- Multiple values formatted nicely: keep colons readable
- Label with attribute [done]
- Label with attrs and value [active]: 42
- Label with multiple attrs [pinned] [urgent]: 8
- Item with children
  - Indented child
  - Child with value: 75
  - Child with attribute [highlight]
- Cache (e.g.: redis): in-memory store
- Standup at 3:30pm runs daily
- Aspect ratio 16:9 for hero images
- URL parses fine: https://example.com/docs
- Note\: escaped colon stays in label
- aspect-ratio:16:9 — no space, kept whole
- Says "hello: world" — quoted speech kept whole
